the knowledge base us_statutes_42_1382b_a includes:


% 42 U.S.C. 1382b(a) — us:statutes/42/1382b/a
the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(5)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(6)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(7)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(9), (10), (11), (14), and (15)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(13)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(13)(B)" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the text of "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a), final sentence" is at "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.yaml".

the alaska native stock inalienability exclusion period years is 20, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(5)".

the assistance resource exclusion period months is 9, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(6)".

the prior underpayment resource exclusion period months is 9, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(7)".

the post receipt resource exclusion period months is 9, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(9), (10), (11), (14), and (15)".

the qualifying gift child age ceiling years is 18, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(13)".

the annual cash gift resource exclusion cap is 2000, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(13)(B)".

the life insurance face value disregard threshold is 1500, as stated in "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a), final sentence".

rule life_insurance_policy_counted_resource_value with provenance "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a), final sentence":
the life insurance policy counted resource value of an asset is an amount N if
    the total face value of all life insurance policies on same person of the asset is an amount M
    and the life insurance face value disregard threshold is an amount K
    and M <= K
    and N = 0
    otherwise the cash surrender value of the asset is N.

rule qualifying_cash_gift_excluded_resource_amount with provenance "42 U.S.C. 1382b(a)(13)(B)":
the qualifying cash gift excluded resource amount of a person is an amount N if
    the individual age years of the person is a number M
    and the qualifying gift child age ceiling years is a number K
    and M < K
    and the individual of the person has life threatening condition
    and the person is gift from organization described in section 501 c 3 exempt under section_501_a
    and the gift of the person is cash
    and the cash gift amount of the person is an amount P
    and the annual cash gift resource exclusion cap is an amount Q
    and the minimum of P and Q is N
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

scenario life_insurance_policy_disregarded_when_total_face_value_at_threshold is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.test.yaml" at case 1:
    asset_1 is an asset.
    the cash surrender value of asset_1 is 900.
    the total face value of all life insurance policies on same person of asset_1 is 1500.
    q_life_insurance_policy_counted_resource_value expects answers ["the life insurance policy counted resource value of asset_1 is 0"].

scenario life_insurance_policy_counted_at_cash_surrender_value_when_total_face_value_exceeds_threshold is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.test.yaml" at case 2:
    asset_1 is an asset.
    the cash surrender value of asset_1 is 900.
    the total face value of all life insurance policies on same person of asset_1 is 1501.
    q_life_insurance_policy_counted_resource_value expects answers ["the life insurance policy counted resource value of asset_1 is 900"].

scenario qualifying_cash_gift_excluded_up_to_annual_cap is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.test.yaml" at case 3:
    person_1 is a person.
    the cash gift amount of person_1 is 2500.
    person_1 is gift from organization described in section 501 c 3 exempt under section_501_a.
    the gift of person_1 is cash.
    the individual age years of person_1 is 17.
    the individual of person_1 has life threatening condition.
    q_qualifying_cash_gift_excluded_resource_amount expects answers ["the qualifying cash gift excluded resource amount of person_1 is 2000"].

scenario cash_gift_not_excluded_when_child_age_condition_fails is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/42/1382b/a.test.yaml" at case 4:
    person_1 is a person.
    the cash gift amount of person_1 is 1000.
    person_1 is gift from organization described in section 501 c 3 exempt under section_501_a.
    the gift of person_1 is cash.
    the individual age years of person_1 is 18.
    the individual of person_1 has life threatening condition.
    q_qualifying_cash_gift_excluded_resource_amount expects answers ["the qualifying cash gift excluded resource amount of person_1 is 0"].

